# PartyOn Phase 3 sample server log (2026-11-03)
# Three real partyon-client processes on one machine: Andrew (session 1, organizer),
# Giovanna (session 2), and LaNaysha (session 3). In order:
#   - Giovanna and LaNaysha send CLAIM_ITEM Cake at the same moment: one 200, one 410
#   - LaNaysha sends a malformed RSVP and gets 300 with the reason
